{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "main_13_level_main_13-03_beg",
  "groupId": "main_13",
  "stageId": "main_13-03",
  "title": "The Mercenary's Day",
  "storyCode": "13-4",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_13-03_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "8f367417dc94d9c4c47d51aab9f1deb67a7b4126172f238d11e84ffd65ccc604",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "General, the Mayor is dead."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Your saber still drips with the blood."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If only the blades of the Military Commission and the mercenaries could be as swift."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "As long as it's a weapon, there's no real difference."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Roger."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "News just came from the mercs. The fourteen MPs in the plot to assassinate the Regent have been apprehended."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And what stance are the other MPs taking?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "They don't have one."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I thought you'd be more direct about your methods."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If the Military Commission requires, I can execute every MP straight away."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "With our current situation, this will suffice. The airship is still under construction; we need just a little extra patience."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Pull your men out. The Nachzehrer King's legion has arrived."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Legion?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "When? How?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Whatever direction a Kazdel army enters Victoria from, they'd have to pass through major duchies. It wouldn't matter how they conceal themselves, that large a force could never—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "His Majesty has arrived at Londinium's suburbs. Two reorganized Royal Court units directly subordinate to him have been stationed outside the city."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I understand. I'll order the mercs to withdraw."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That Lt. Colonel Lettou had his talk with the Regent. He and his Defense Forces will soon be assuming control over all of Londinium's administrative affairs."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "On the surface, Londinium will enter a state of semi-martial control led by the Defense Forces, owing to the 'garrisoned rebellion'."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Don't think that'll fool the Grand Dukes... their intelligence networks are well developed in the city. They'll definitely start mobilizing for war within the next few months."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It won't take that long. It's exceedingly likely the quickest army will show up beneath Londinium's walls within twenty days."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But no fear. No matter who arrives first, they won't be hasty to act."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Any duke that dares march alone will become the common enemy of all, just as in the Duke of Windermere's failure of a raid two years ago."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Her high-speed warships didn't even succeed in launching from their berths before her own men obstructed her. It was ridiculous."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The Duke of Windermere... She's clever. She's been warning Parliament since the day the Regent first made contact with Victoria."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Cavendish didn't just invite us to enter Londinium on his lonesome. Each and every duke was hoping to make a 'military vassal' out of the Regent, an assistant to the thorns in their sides."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Understand? This Duke of Windermere is no exception. Behind the guise of the iron-fisted soldier, she obeys the game logic of aristocrats as much as the rest."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "She was just the one most impatient to place us back in the toolbox."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "From what I hear, Victoria's legendary Steam Knights don't exist anymore."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You <i>do</i> have a nose for sniffing, Hoederer. Not a good quality for a serviceman."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm a mercenary, General."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The Regent and Military Commission's scheme was a huge success. Pretty crazy. Somehow, the Sarkaz have a firm hold on Victoria's capital."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The dukes need an easy-to-cut-up army to put down dissidents, and Parliament is desperate for an 'appropriate' defense, to avoid any more action like those two stupid dukes' adventures."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "In their eyes, the Sarkaz came fresh out of civil war on a silver platter, table ready, disposable."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Now, we've taken the industrial sector, leashed Parliament, and even The Shard will be under our control any day now. The Regent's taken Londinium, for real."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But we can't shunt this city off."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We can stir up conflict, but then what? We end up buried together with Londinium under a coalition of foreign militaries?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What <i>is</i> the Commission planning?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Do mercenaries have so many problems, Hoederer? Have I given you too much leeway?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I only need to know what the goal I'm serving is."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The mercenaries <i>I</i> know have other tastes. Inquiring as to the more loose-pocketed employer, or mulling over how to waylay a Sankta caravan."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...I just have different personal habits."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "'Personal habits'."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Is your eye alright?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...It affects my depth perception in sword combat. I'll get used to it ASAP."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I received your interrogation records. The assassin was an Ines woman, a mercenary alike."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We sure didn't expect a Sarkaz like Ines to get bought out by Parliament, especially for a hit on the Regent."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ines is dead, and you lost an eye for it. You'll receive commendations from the Military Commission."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No commendations necessary."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Then you'll receive payment, in mercenary fashion."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "After all, you and Ines, and that lunatic with the W callsign, led an active mercenary unit for quite some time. The old Sarkaz of the Scar Market, <i>their</i> commendations for you are blinding."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Very decisive of you to kill her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's the only way a mercenary lives. We'll do anything to survive."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Even gutting your own colleagues?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Even gutting our own colleagues."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Then I'm sure one day you'll come to dispatch me. Won't you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You asked me just now. What could the Military Commission be planning?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Our plan is only drawn up to the point war breaks out. As for what follows, that would be... <i>their</i> plan to make."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "This place is the heart of hatred, and it will be buried by vengeance."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Just as you wrote in those booklets. Just as every war we've been through."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So you were..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Never mind that. Carry on writing."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You've a heavy mission. Bear that responsibility."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Done with your notes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No, I wasn't writing anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Just giving this sword another polish. The mercenary claymore... I haven't used this thing in forever."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You're so heartless."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If you want it, you can have it. A present from me to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "A sword? Low efficiency, zero interest."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "*sigh*... And you found the time to fix your hair?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Can't blame you, I guess. We're not going to have the time for hair gel like you did back in Londinium."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's just more convenient this way."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You should've kept that outfit. Maybe you could keep acting the merc leader, treasure of the army?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What's that thing army guys say? It's your calling to serve?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "A mercenary's calling is to get paid, not get bereavement. Knock it off and save your spittle, you two."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Defense perimeter, scouting radius. Is this the opening?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Until they started fighting, yeah."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "As for now... they're marching. No matter how much the dukes hate each other's guts, this front's gonna close in sooner or later."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You're sure your guy's gonna pass this position? You can literally see The Shard's Catastrophe clouds from here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The Catastrophe's landing point is the line of fire between the Duke of Wellington and the Nachzehrer King. Chances are the Iron Duke will retreat his front."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "As for Windermere, she probably won't have the spare energy to deploy her own forces until she gets her daughter back inside a nomadic fortress."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "My 'guy' doesn't have a lot of exit routes from Londinium."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Wait. Incoming."
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The shadow's very fast. It's like...\nEr, a polygonal... yarn ball?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "A what?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The overall shape is polygonal, but highly irregular."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's Arts. High chance the naked eye can't follow it, or else she wouldn't make it here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Target confirmed. We can only afford a little rough play."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "W—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
