    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Traveler?",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(In ancient Sarkaz) The ash-bleached city lies ahead. Let us hasten."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Traveler?",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(In ancient Sarkaz) It will admit us. The children of the soil and stone have built city walls on Sorrow's Ground."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Traveler?",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(In ancient Sarkaz) Kazdel. Each syllable is a bitter journey unto its own."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Traveler?",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(In ancient Sarkaz) Where is it? From dreams we have departed, seeking to this day."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Traveler?",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(In ancient Sarkaz) The age of exile has come to an end—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What are they saying?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's an ancient Sarkaz dialect."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "'Sorrow's ground'. 'Ash-bleached city'. I'm having trouble with the rest—I can only guess."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I think they mentioned Kazdel too? Which one?"
